  "paired_metadata_and_contract_obligations": [
    "Create a versioned U15 symbol variant with NC6 and NC9 passive routing lands, NC10 unused, real IO1 explicitly unused, IO4 on PORT_C_RX_EXT; all other symbols and external/MCU assignments fixed.",
    "Regenerate paired schematic, exact pad-net assignments, netlist and ERC/parity expectations together; current copper-only incremental importer does not authorize or implement these four pad-net changes.",
    "Version branch-view BONDED RX from U15.1 to U15.5; U15.6 is upstream only, U15.1/10 no longer have RX roles; keep actual TX U15.2 foreign during RX branch routing and vice versa.",
    "Version role scopes, endpoint contracts, TVS actual-IO coverage and logical mapping transparently. Preserve recipe-to-native UUID provenance. Do not edit historical contract in place.",
